-- ============================================================
-- Marksmanship: Improved Concussive Shot -> Lethal Instincts
-- ============================================================
--
-- TODO.md: "Your Arcane Shot, Chimera Shot, Aimed Shot and Steady Shot have a
--  50/100% chance to refresh the duration of Instinctive Fire, and Instinctive
--  Fire is extended by 3/6 seconds (2 ranks)"
--
-- Renamed from Improved Concussive Shot and given Instinctive Fire's own icon
-- (SpellIconID 5000), because the talent no longer has anything to do with
-- Concussive Shot -- it exists to sustain and lengthen Instinctive Fire.
--
-- Two halves, and only the first needs code:
--
--   Effect1 (dummy) -- the refresh.  This cannot be data.  A DBC
--   EffectTriggerSpell of 200742 would *apply* the buff, handing permanent
--   ranged haste to a hunter who never presses the button, and a CasterAuraSpell
--   gate does not save it: a proc-triggered cast runs with TRIGGERED_FULL_MASK,
--   which contains TRIGGERED_IGNORE_CASTER_AURASTATE (SpellDefines.h:145), so
--   the check at Spell.cpp:5756 never runs.  spell_hun_lethal_instincts
--   refreshes only what is already there.
--
--   Effect2 (ADD_FLAT_MODIFIER, MiscValue 1 = SPELLMOD_DURATION) -- the
--   extension.  Pure data, and it applies to EVERY application of the buff,
--   including a plain Instinctive Fire cast with no proc involved.  That is why
--   it is a spellmod rather than something the refresh handler does: the script
--   only ever sees the proc path.
--
-- Base points 2999/5999, not 3000/6000: a flat modifier's value is
-- BasePoints + max(1, DieSides), and $/1000;s2 renders that same total as 3 / 6.
--
-- The class mask goes in EffectSpellClassMaskB3 -- effect TWO, word THREE.  The
-- letter is the effect index and the digit is the flag96 word; Missile Barrage
-- (44401) settles it, carrying A1 = B1 = C1 = 2048 for three effects that each
-- modify Arcane Missiles, whose family flag is word0 0x800.
--
-- EffectSpellClassMaskA1 is zeroed deliberately.  512 (Concussive Shot) was the
-- mask for the old ADD_FLAT_MODIFIER; a stale mask left on a dummy effect is the
-- inheritance trap CLAUDE.md calls out for cloned rows.



